   "hookSource": null,
   "color": "#ec4899",
   "long": "Eleven of the most binge-worthy games in a \"5 minutes in line / on the bus / before bed\" format. Genres straight from the top mobile charts — Memory Match, Find the Difference, Hidden Object (Visual Search), Wordscapes-style word puzzles, sudoku, SET, visual memory, Schulte tables, typo hunting, arcade targets. The goal is the joy of micro-wins — a dopamine hit every 30-60 seconds. Along the way it keeps memory, attention, and verbal skills in shape. For anyone who wants light cognitive downtime on a break — especially women 25-55, moms, HR and teachers, nurses, sales pros.",
